{"id":"n63504-1-11","stage":5,"title":"색채 · 色彩","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63504-1-11-1","ko":"들판의 풍경 좀 봐. 색채가 정말 아름답지 않니?","zh":"看看田野里的景色吧。这些色彩真的非常美丽，对不对？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"들판의","meaning":"田野","explanation":"들판：田野；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"들판","audio":"/audio/139a0642958094543da1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49969","senseId":"1","lemma":"들판","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들판의","audio":"/audio/0972aaa4bf47b1af3dc9.mp3"}},{"text":"풍경","meaning":"风景，风光，景色，景致","explanation":"풍경：风景，风光，景色，景致","readings":[{"term":"풍경","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72392","senseId":"1","lemma":"풍경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풍경","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"색채가","meaning":"色彩","explanation":"색채：色彩；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"색채","audio":"/audio/467a1fe67643f02ebfb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63504","senseId":"1","lemma":"색채","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"색채가","audio":"/audio/c590a29a0ab68f3cc109.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"아름답지","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름답지","audio":"/audio/1dc2f636fb64fd8c027d.mp3"}},{"text":"않니?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않니","audio":"/audio/b88940bd6e0a2977df5b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"139a064295809454","term":"들판","zh":"田野","audio":"/audio/139a0642958094543da1.mp3","entryId":"49969","definition":"广阔的原野。","pronunciation":["들ː판"]},{"id":"64d560d21687616f","term":"풍경","zh":"风景，风光，景色，景致","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3","entryId":"72392","definition":"大自然或某一地区的美景。","pronunciation":["풍경"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"467a1fe67643f02e","term":"색채","zh":"色彩","audio":"/audio/467a1fe67643f02ebfb7.mp3","entryId":"63504","definition":"物体在光照下显现出的颜色。","pronunciation":["색채"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":["아름답따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3